{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.GroupTheory.Coxeter.Length","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Finsupp.LinearCombination","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.Rs_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.Rs_sq","kind":"theorem","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwBasis.lean#L112-L119","doc":"**The Hecke quadratic relation, as an operator identity.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.Rs_Rs_single","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.Rs_Rs_single","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwBasis.lean#L83-L109","doc":"**The Hecke quadratic relation for the right-multiplication operator.**\n`Rs i ∘ Rs i = (q-1) Rs i + q · id` on every basis vector. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.length_flip","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.length_flip","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwBasis.lean#L72-L80","doc":"The two length branches are exclusive and exhaustive, and applying `s i`\ntwice returns to `w`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.Rs_single","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.Rs_single","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwBasis.lean#L68-L70","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.Rs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.Rs","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwBasis.lean#L64-L66","doc":"Right multiplication by `T_{s i}` on the free module with basis `W`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.rsFun","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.rsFun","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwBasis.lean#L56-L62","doc":"The image of the basis vector `T_w` under right multiplication by `T_{s i}`:\n`T_{w s_i}` when the length goes up, `(q-1)T_w + q T_{w s_i}` when it goes down. ","signatureChunk":0}]}